WEBVTT

00:16.620 --> 00:19.450
I never dreamed before

00:19.450 --> 00:22.290
I'm gonna knock the door

00:22.290 --> 00:25.860
into the world of perfect free

00:25.860 --> 00:27.960
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:27.960 --> 00:30.800
You're gonna say I'm lying

00:30.800 --> 00:33.530
I'm gonna get the chance

00:33.530 --> 00:37.100
I thought a chance is far from me

00:37.100 --> 00:38.270
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:38.270 --> 00:41.180
I was made to hit in America

00:41.180 --> 00:44.040
(I was made to hit in America)

00:44.040 --> 00:49.950
I was made to hit in America

00:49.950 --> 00:53.620
You are the sun, you are the star

00:53.620 --> 00:55.620
(To me, forever)

00:55.620 --> 00:59.330
You are the sun, you are the star

00:59.330 --> 01:02.520
(To me, forever)

01:09.400 --> 01:15.010
I was made to hit in America

01:15.010 --> 01:17.850
I was made to hit in America

01:17.850 --> 01:20.710
(I was made to hit in America)

01:20.710 --> 01:23.520
I was made to hit in America

01:23.520 --> 01:26.290
(I was made to hit in America)

01:26.290 --> 01:33.960
I was made to hit in America

01:51.750 --> 01:55.580
-I'm thinking of quitting this life.
-Is it because of a woman?

01:55.580 --> 01:57.640
Yeah, well...

02:05.690 --> 02:08.600
Tanaka-kun! Tanaka-kun!

02:08.600 --> 02:09.700
Uhh...

02:09.700 --> 02:12.170
Page 31.

02:12.170 --> 02:13.900
Thanks.

02:13.900 --> 02:15.870
"Classical Japanese"

02:15.870 --> 02:18.710
"Classical Japanese"

02:15.870 --> 02:18.710
"The color of the flowers
of the twin sal trees

02:18.710 --> 02:22.480
"Classical Japanese"

02:18.710 --> 02:22.480
is a manifestation of the saying,
"All that prosper must decline."

02:22.480 --> 02:22.740
"Classical Japanese"

02:23.380 --> 02:25.750
Good for you, Tanaka!

02:25.750 --> 02:30.520
However, this is your English period.

02:30.520 --> 02:32.490
Quiet down!

02:38.230 --> 02:41.160
How long is this life going to continue?

02:42.460 --> 02:47.330
At the age of 14,
my life was at a dead end.

02:48.370 --> 02:52.430
That is...until I met him.

03:01.920 --> 03:03.820
"Live 1: The View at Fourteen"

03:03.820 --> 03:06.590
"Live 1: The View at Fourteen"

03:03.820 --> 03:06.590
This is a message from
your Student Council.

03:06.590 --> 03:06.950
The equipment used by the
various clubs should be stored-

03:06.950 --> 03:09.480
The equipment used by the
various clubs should be stored-

03:09.480 --> 03:11.480
Tanabe, did you read that article?

03:11.480 --> 03:13.990
Yeah. Isn't that something?

03:13.990 --> 03:16.060
The first batter up,
and in the major league, too!

03:16.060 --> 03:18.360
Yeah...

03:18.360 --> 03:19.930
The way our lives have been,

03:19.930 --> 03:22.430
we'll never be able to write
an interesting autobiography.

03:22.430 --> 03:24.100
Hey, Tanaka...

03:24.100 --> 03:26.930
Are you living your life
to write an autobiography?

03:26.930 --> 03:30.370
Of course not. But...

03:30.370 --> 03:33.940
Let's enjoy life! C'mon!

03:33.940 --> 03:34.970
Hey, Tanabe!

03:34.970 --> 03:38.040
-C'mon, Yoshida-kun!
-Have you gained weight, Kazuko?

03:38.040 --> 03:41.050
Listen, I shortened my
100-meter time by two seconds!

03:41.050 --> 03:43.380
I found this great shaved ice shop.
Why don't we go?

03:43.380 --> 03:45.850
Don't splash me!

03:47.150 --> 03:49.060
Oh, this is great!

03:49.060 --> 03:51.120
This is good! It's good! It's good!

03:51.120 --> 03:55.230
Oh! It's Ishiguro-sempai!

03:55.230 --> 03:57.760
A beautiful face and dynamite body!

03:57.760 --> 04:01.270
A great athlete and her grades
are always in the top ten!

04:01.270 --> 04:04.070
Izumi Ishiguro's the perfect
Miss Higashi Middle School!

04:04.070 --> 04:06.970
She gets me hot all over! I can't stand it!

04:06.970 --> 04:08.810
-You're next!
-Okay!

04:08.810 --> 04:12.380
Okay...I'm gonna snap away...

04:12.380 --> 04:14.710
I'll sell 'em all and make me a fortune!

04:17.550 --> 04:20.490
Hey! What are you doing?!

04:21.320 --> 04:25.550
I see. You want to take some too?
Is that it?

04:38.440 --> 04:43.740
Back then, Izumi-chain was
the first person to talk to me.

04:48.050 --> 04:51.850
"Thank you for your years of patronage.
Nakajima Calligraphy School"
"Tenant Wanted"

05:20.410 --> 05:22.320
-Izumi-chan...
-Give it back!

05:22.320 --> 05:25.810
Until three years ago,
that's what I called her.

05:26.790 --> 05:28.860
Someone's over there!

05:28.860 --> 05:32.850
See?! There are two guys over there!

05:37.660 --> 05:41.400
Who are they?! 7th graders?!

05:41.400 --> 05:43.160
Somebody you know, Izumi?

05:46.140 --> 05:48.910
-They had a camera, those two.
-Catch them!

05:48.910 --> 05:50.540
Koyuki?

05:52.750 --> 05:56.650
Man, they got a good look at us.

05:56.650 --> 05:59.420
Come on. Let's go to the game center.

05:59.420 --> 06:01.440
Hurry up, Tanaka!

06:05.990 --> 06:08.550
Hey, stop that!

06:11.060 --> 06:12.370
Get lost!

06:12.370 --> 06:14.300
Yeah, that's it! Go!

06:17.540 --> 06:19.030
Thanks!

06:33.390 --> 06:36.180
Did it! The Golden Bat!

06:38.730 --> 06:42.030
-Wanna eat a beef bowl?
-I'll pass. I'm broke.

06:42.030 --> 06:44.500
I see. See ya!

06:51.900 --> 06:54.430
This place seems a little iffy...

06:58.910 --> 07:00.510
Whaddya want?!

07:00.510 --> 07:02.570
Ouch...

07:06.950 --> 07:09.220
Oww...

07:10.560 --> 07:11.820
Man...

07:13.530 --> 07:15.430
What am I doing?

07:21.070 --> 07:22.590
Oww!

07:23.970 --> 07:26.110
Yay! Now it's my turn! Hold him!

07:26.110 --> 07:29.540
You can't get away from us!

07:29.540 --> 07:31.440
Wait!

07:33.050 --> 07:34.670
Damn!

07:36.450 --> 07:39.490
What's with that dog?!

07:39.490 --> 07:44.960
Hey, what are you doing?
Quit tormenting the dog!

07:44.960 --> 07:47.460
Aw, shut up! Let's get outta here!

07:47.460 --> 07:50.000
Yeah!

07:50.000 --> 07:53.300
Beck! Come here!

07:53.300 --> 07:56.800
I told you, you shouldn't go out alone.

07:56.800 --> 07:59.800
You...You made me worried.

08:01.110 --> 08:03.870
That guy's...a foreigner?

08:05.550 --> 08:07.280
Doesn't this dog look weird?

08:07.280 --> 08:10.280
No, no...Not bad dog...

08:10.280 --> 08:12.590
Huh? You're Japanese?

08:12.590 --> 08:15.820
Thanks for saving Beck.

08:15.820 --> 08:18.290
Doggy...Come here, doggy.

08:18.290 --> 08:20.780
Good boy...

08:22.830 --> 08:27.360
Uh-uh. You shouldn't put your hand out
to a frightened dog.

08:31.000 --> 08:33.110
-Use these.
-Thanks.

08:33.110 --> 08:34.600
See ya.

08:38.010 --> 08:39.880
"Onochin Loans"
(This is a pack of tissues)

08:44.280 --> 08:47.310
I'll return this to you next time!

08:50.420 --> 08:51.820
Is that for real?

08:51.820 --> 08:56.450
Yeah. First I get punched,
and then I get bitten...What a day!

08:57.430 --> 09:00.130
No way...That's awful!

09:01.730 --> 09:07.070
That weird dog...I hope
it doesn't have rabies.

09:07.070 --> 09:09.380
Hey! There's someone here
to see you, Tanaka!

09:09.380 --> 09:12.110
It's Ishiguro-sempai!

09:14.610 --> 09:16.550
Uhh...Don't let them bother you.

09:16.550 --> 09:19.620
Listen, are you free on Saturday, Koyuki?

09:19.620 --> 09:20.780
Huh?!

09:23.320 --> 09:25.460
What happened? You get into a fight?

09:25.460 --> 09:28.490
It's nothing. I'm perfectly fine now.

09:28.490 --> 09:30.500
Listen, Koyuki...

09:30.500 --> 09:33.230
There was another boy
with the same name as me,

09:33.230 --> 09:35.370
Yukio Tanaka, in our calligraphy class.

09:35.370 --> 09:38.940
So Izumi-chan gave me
the nickname Koyuki.
(Ko = little)

09:38.940 --> 09:41.170
That's why she calls me Koyuki.

09:41.170 --> 09:42.140
"Koyuki"
That's why she calls me Koyuki.

09:42.140 --> 09:43.040
"Koyuki"

09:43.610 --> 09:48.580
I'm going bowling with some friends.
Won't you come with us?

09:48.580 --> 09:49.450
Yeah...

09:49.450 --> 09:52.450
Oh, good. Now we have enough people.

09:52.450 --> 09:56.460
It's almost exam time, so it's
hard getting everyone to join in.

09:56.460 --> 10:00.290
I didn't want to waste
the coupon Kayo-chan gave me.

10:01.460 --> 10:03.430
Koyuki...Thanks.

10:03.430 --> 10:04.730
Yeah...

10:04.730 --> 10:08.530
Oh, I have P.E. Next. See you Saturday!

10:11.200 --> 10:13.040
I can't believe it...

10:13.040 --> 10:14.970
You're telling me...

10:24.450 --> 10:27.690
-You seem to be happy.
-Yeah, well...

10:27.690 --> 10:30.320
-Don't stay out too late, now!
-I won't.

10:31.790 --> 10:35.360
The uptown-bound train
will be pulling in to track two.

10:35.360 --> 10:39.330
Please wait behind the yellow line.

10:39.330 --> 10:41.360
Wait behind the yellow line!

10:43.770 --> 10:46.610
Yay! I got a strike!

10:46.610 --> 10:48.400
Nice, Izumi-chan!

10:57.980 --> 11:00.190
We'll never win at this rate!

11:00.190 --> 11:03.690
Come on, Izumi. Let's switch teams.

11:03.690 --> 11:05.160
Koyuki...

11:07.730 --> 11:10.660
Try aiming at those marks in front of you.

11:21.210 --> 11:23.440
Yay! Alright!

11:23.440 --> 11:25.380
Pretty good advice, don't you think?

11:25.380 --> 11:27.710
Oh, no. It's me...My talent.

11:27.710 --> 11:29.280
Yay!

11:29.280 --> 11:31.150
You're pretty good, Koyuki!

11:33.050 --> 11:34.990
-Yes!
-Good job!

11:34.990 --> 11:38.620
At that moment, the two years
we hadn't seen each other...

11:38.620 --> 11:40.560
...vanished completely.

11:50.300 --> 11:52.070
Boy, am I hungry!

11:52.070 --> 11:54.740
-Let's go to McDonald's!
-How about Mr. Donut?

11:54.740 --> 11:56.510
I'd rather have a Yoshinoya beef bowl.

11:56.510 --> 11:58.340
-Huh?!
-Huh?!
-Huh?!

11:58.340 --> 12:00.510
What do I want?

12:00.510 --> 12:03.980
I'll go by myself...

12:03.980 --> 12:06.790
Oh! Kayo-chan!

12:06.790 --> 12:08.190
Kayo-chan!

12:08.190 --> 12:10.690
Oh, Izumichi!

12:10.690 --> 12:12.730
Yeah!

12:12.730 --> 12:13.930
What are you doing?

12:13.930 --> 12:17.430
We're trying to decide whether
to go to McDonald's or Yoshinoya.

12:17.430 --> 12:18.630
McDonald's!

12:18.630 --> 12:21.970
I'm not hungry. Let's go somewhere else.

12:21.970 --> 12:24.400
Kayo-chan, you're reeking of alcohol...

12:29.840 --> 12:33.510
-I hear it's pretty good.
-No way...

12:35.110 --> 12:36.910
Oh, come on...

12:49.030 --> 12:50.500
Yay!

12:55.170 --> 12:57.640
Are you drinking, Koyuki-kun?

12:57.640 --> 13:02.370
Yes. I'm on my second glass
of oolong tea.

13:02.370 --> 13:04.780
Shall we all go for karaoke?

13:04.780 --> 13:09.850
I'll pass. I've never been to a
karaoke place, and I'm out of money.

13:09.850 --> 13:13.790
But Izumichi was raving
about your singing...

13:13.790 --> 13:15.960
Here you go! It's on the house, kids!

13:15.960 --> 13:19.290
Oh, Mit-chan...Did you
have a chef's license?

13:19.290 --> 13:20.760
'Course not.

13:27.700 --> 13:32.340
-What's Mit-chan-san's real name?
-Why?

13:32.340 --> 13:33.840
I want to thank him,

13:33.840 --> 13:37.280
but I don't think a kid like me
should be calling him Mit-chan...

13:37.280 --> 13:40.210
Why, I don't mind you calling me Mit-chan.

13:41.210 --> 13:44.180
Thanks for the food, Mit-chan-san!

13:44.180 --> 13:47.120
You know, we have a lot of regulars,

13:47.120 --> 13:49.590
but none of them knows
what the others do.

13:49.590 --> 13:53.390
They don't even know if their names
are real or just nicknames.

13:53.390 --> 13:57.890
It's Remedy's policy not
to bring problems in here.

14:01.870 --> 14:04.300
But that means you're breaking up with me!

14:04.300 --> 14:07.600
As I said, I don't have the time.

14:10.080 --> 14:12.480
Oh, man...

14:12.480 --> 14:14.550
Damn you, Ryusuke...

14:14.550 --> 14:18.520
He's called Ryusuke. Mature for 16.

14:18.520 --> 14:21.790
-You know him?
-Uhh...no...

14:21.790 --> 14:27.090
He's the worst...Making girls cry,
not paying back money he owes...

14:27.090 --> 14:28.650
No way...

14:29.800 --> 14:31.630
But, how can I put it?

14:31.630 --> 14:37.090
He has a strange attraction
for other people, that Ryusuke.

14:38.240 --> 14:42.940
-Besides, he's always bluffing.
-Mit-chan, sake!

14:42.940 --> 14:44.980
Bluffing?

14:44.980 --> 14:47.410
Koyuki, have you heard of Dying Breed?

14:48.880 --> 14:54.080
There's this super popular band
called Dying Breed in America.

14:55.050 --> 15:00.190
What about Dying Breed? I love them!

15:00.190 --> 15:04.630
He says he used to play in a band
with Eddy, Dying Breed's guitarist.

15:13.410 --> 15:15.460
Who are you talking about?

15:17.180 --> 15:19.580
You idiot...

15:19.580 --> 15:23.240
Come on. You've got
other guys besides me.

15:25.150 --> 15:30.250
Ryusuke! Which is more important
to you?! Me or the band?!

15:31.320 --> 15:32.850
The band.

15:39.030 --> 15:42.740
Mit-chan-san...Would you give this to him?

15:42.740 --> 15:43.830
Sure...

15:47.110 --> 15:50.380
Wasn't it like a drama back there?

15:50.380 --> 15:52.910
Yeah. It was really something.

15:52.910 --> 15:54.450
Hey!

15:54.450 --> 15:57.980
Hey! Hey! Come look at this!

15:57.980 --> 16:01.320
Somebody really did a job on this car.

16:01.320 --> 16:04.190
It's gonna cost a mint to fix it.

16:04.190 --> 16:07.760
Sempai, I don't think
you should get too close.

16:07.760 --> 16:10.060
What is it? Killjoy.

16:10.060 --> 16:15.030
Hey! What the fuck are
you doing to my car?!

16:15.030 --> 16:19.770
Whatsa matter, you fuckers around
here speak English, or what?

16:19.770 --> 16:22.440
Oh...I'm...sorry...

16:22.440 --> 16:24.540
Sempai! Why are you apologizing?!

16:24.540 --> 16:26.570
W-well...

16:33.720 --> 16:36.240
-You leaving?
-Yeah...

16:37.260 --> 16:40.660
A young kid asked me to give this to you.

16:40.660 --> 16:44.820
To me? Thanks, Mit-chan.

16:46.630 --> 16:48.030
Fuckin' stupid little kids!

16:48.030 --> 16:50.970
I'm gonna make you pay
for all of this right now!

16:50.970 --> 16:55.170
No, no. We are not guilty. We-

16:56.240 --> 17:00.850
What are you, a rapper or a singer?
"We are the world?!"

17:00.850 --> 17:04.850
I'll kick your ass if you don't pay!
I'm serious. Shut the...

17:04.850 --> 17:06.590
...fuck up!

17:06.590 --> 17:09.020
Back off, damn you!

17:09.020 --> 17:09.990
Koyuki...

17:09.990 --> 17:13.320
Don't act big just because
you're overgrown, dumbass (baka yaro)!

17:14.760 --> 17:17.190
Ba...ka?

17:18.960 --> 17:21.230
Nobody calls me baka around here!

17:21.230 --> 17:24.340
You little shit! I'm kicking
your fucking ass, man! Right about now!

17:24.340 --> 17:26.770
Stop it!

17:26.770 --> 17:30.940
I saw your car two hours ago
and it was already scratched.

17:30.940 --> 17:33.540
Who the hell are you?!

17:35.880 --> 17:38.580
You should apologize to these kids.

17:38.580 --> 17:40.850
What the fuck?!

17:40.850 --> 17:42.550
Apologize.

17:44.720 --> 17:46.090
Apologize!

17:49.460 --> 17:51.130
The police are right there.

17:51.130 --> 17:53.330
Shut the fuck up, kid!

17:53.330 --> 17:55.600
Here, let's get somewhere else.

17:57.270 --> 17:58.800
Come on!

17:58.800 --> 18:00.290
Come on, he says...

18:03.280 --> 18:05.480
Ryusuke-kun!

18:05.480 --> 18:07.450
Never mind me. Get on home.

18:10.880 --> 18:12.480
"Noodles"

18:12.480 --> 18:14.790
"Noodles"

18:12.480 --> 18:14.790
Here are your ramen noodles.

18:14.790 --> 18:16.850
"Noodles"

18:14.790 --> 18:16.850
This looks good!

18:17.820 --> 18:22.590
But those French fries...
Weren't they just awful?

18:27.300 --> 18:30.000
You haven't finished your ramen.

18:30.000 --> 18:36.040
Yeah...But I really want
to eat a beef bowl!

18:36.040 --> 18:37.670
Koyuki...

18:58.260 --> 19:02.470
Hey, hey-hey hey!
I-It's cool, man. It's cool.

19:02.470 --> 19:04.900
Put that thing down, man, please.

19:04.900 --> 19:07.070
Put it down. Take it easy.

19:07.070 --> 19:07.940
Please...

19:07.940 --> 19:10.810
Well...Wanna try?

19:10.810 --> 19:16.980
I don't know about your town,
but my friends in New York died.

19:16.980 --> 19:20.290
You can't fuck around in my neighborhood.

19:20.290 --> 19:23.060
Get the fuck outta here! Fucking bastard!

19:23.060 --> 19:25.550
-No! No! Leave it!
-Don't shoot! Don't shoot!

19:31.360 --> 19:33.090
Ryusuke-kun!

19:35.370 --> 19:38.930
Damn...Treating me like trash...

19:40.170 --> 19:42.370
Shit!

19:42.370 --> 19:44.410
R-Ryusuke-kun! Are you all right?!

19:44.410 --> 19:48.650
They were so drunk, I didn't
think they'd figure it out.

19:48.650 --> 19:51.050
Man...it hurts...

19:53.620 --> 19:56.260
I was impressed.

19:56.260 --> 20:01.490
You're such a shorty, but you
went after those big foreigners.

20:01.490 --> 20:03.730
What's the matter?

20:03.730 --> 20:06.990
Hey, hey...I'm the one
who should be crying.

20:08.770 --> 20:13.410
I'm sorry. But lately...
for a long time, actually,

20:13.410 --> 20:18.780
I felt like no one cared if I lived or not.

20:18.780 --> 20:20.300
Koyuki!

20:23.050 --> 20:24.740
It's them...

20:29.120 --> 20:30.190
Hey, you guys-

20:30.190 --> 20:33.990
-Are you all right?
-I'm just scratched up.

20:33.990 --> 20:36.730
The other day, he saved my dog.

20:36.730 --> 20:38.100
Your dog?

20:38.100 --> 20:42.370
Beck is a dog Eddy and I found
when we were in a band together.

20:42.370 --> 20:45.770
-Oh, so that's a true story?
-Oh, sorry Koyuki-kun.

20:45.770 --> 20:49.830
-Sorry I'm so late.
-Yeah...

20:51.340 --> 20:54.080
I love the Dying Breed!

20:54.080 --> 20:57.450
Oh? Then why don't you come
and see our band sometime?

20:57.450 --> 21:00.350
Yes! I will! That's so exciting!

21:00.350 --> 21:02.750
Matt of Dying Breed is really funny.

21:02.750 --> 21:06.660
If he doesn't have a drink before
a show he can't get up on the stage.

21:15.970 --> 21:18.160
That looks pretty weird to me.

21:20.040 --> 21:25.110
Now I'm pretty worried...
for Ishiguro-sempai.

21:25.110 --> 21:27.940
I don't give a damn about you, though.

21:33.220 --> 21:39.650
So cheer up...

21:40.630 --> 21:42.460
Sorry to keep you waiting!

21:44.630 --> 21:46.800
This is Ryusuke-kun's address...

21:46.800 --> 21:48.970
Okay...Shall we barge in on him?

21:48.970 --> 21:51.460
Huh? Right now?

21:57.640 --> 22:01.780
Koyuki...What kind of music
do you listen to?

22:01.780 --> 22:06.250
-Chiemi Kuniyoshi.
-Kuniyoshi? Oh, that idol singer?

22:06.250 --> 22:10.550
Yeah...I'm sure she's going
to break out soon.

22:17.060 --> 22:19.700
I think it's this way.

22:19.700 --> 22:21.330
Maybe...

22:21.330 --> 22:25.070
And, after taking a lot of wrong turns,

22:25.070 --> 22:27.630
we finally arrived at Ryusuke-kun's home.

22:31.940 --> 22:41.220
"Fishing"

22:51.260 --> 22:53.360
Another minute

22:53.360 --> 22:56.190
Feelin' so fine

22:58.360 --> 23:00.600
You turn the freeze

23:00.600 --> 23:03.230
into warm light

23:05.440 --> 23:09.010
Had a premonition

23:09.010 --> 23:11.710
